 "remarks": "OFFER DEADLINE: MONDAY, NOVEMBER 9 AT 12:00 PM EST. Nestled in South Norwalk's charming Harbor Shores neighborhood, 20 Naromake Avenue seamlessly blends coastal character, timeless design, and modern living. Originally built in 1922, this beautifully reimagined home underwent an extensive reconstruction in 2017, including being elevated above the floodplain. Offering 4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, and approximately 2,679 square feet, the home combines thoughtful design with exceptional functionality. Natural light fills the inviting interior, highlighting rich hardwood floors, exposed wood beams, and an effortless open-concept layout. The stunning chef's kitchen features quartz countertops, crisp white cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and an oversized island that flows seamlessly into the dining and living areas. A fireplace and custom built-ins add warmth and character, while French doors open to an expansive deck overlooking the fully fenced backyard, perfect for outdoor entertaining and everyday enjoyment.",
